<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank placed $6.37 bln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank placed $6.37 bln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's central bank said Wednesday it placed $6.37 billion in overnight reverse repurchase agreements Feb 18.</p>
<p>The reverse repos were placed at 4.75 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
</text>
